{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">汪明荃（阿姐）與羅家英（家英哥）相愛多年，感情一直深厚。適逢家英哥80歲大壽，阿姐特意為老公舉辦了一場熱鬧的壽宴，邀請了眾多親朋好友齊聚一堂，共同慶祝這個極具意義的日子，並發文寫道：「羅家英80大壽。恭喜你身體健康、開心長壽！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"cf7c19af-908b-4305-9d53-5d7e3f70d7b3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026MSVD01RiSz1791455782.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"cf7c19af-908b-4305-9d53-5d7e3f70d7b3.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">從壽宴相片可見，現場氣氛相當溫馨熱鬧。壽宴台上的大屏幕印有紅梅圖案及「羅家英八十大壽」的字眼。身為主角的家英哥精神奕奕，阿姐則穿上色彩繽紛的連身裙，打扮高貴優雅，兩夫妻並肩而坐合照，默契十足。他們更一同捧著一個裝飾著滿滿壽桃、寫有巨大「80」字樣及「家英哥 福如東海 健康開心」祝賀語的兩層粉紅色生日蛋糕，畫面十分甜蜜幸福。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"baebe6f9-7c7d-4fc5-9882-606fb538d1ff.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20260QwBVJPZBS1791455825.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"baebe6f9-7c7d-4fc5-9882-606fb538d1ff.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"efc2cf18-d600-4e4b-ac00-be43daf10fb0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20269red0UNoPo1791455781.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"efc2cf18-d600-4e4b-ac00-be43daf10fb0.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">阿姐與家英哥在圈內外均相識滿天下，壽宴當晚筵開多席。兩人除了親自走到圓桌旁與席上的賓客舉杯敬酒暢飲外，亦與幾十位親朋好友一同拍攝了盛大的大合照，見證家英哥的好人緣。壽宴上更上演了傳統尊師重道的感人一幕，相中可見有後輩特意雙膝跪地向家英哥敬茶，家英哥面帶慈祥笑容雙手接過茶杯，坐在旁邊的阿姐亦流露出欣慰滿意的神情。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T11:19:04.428453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}